  "description": "Bring rugged frontier soul and classic Americana heritage to your designs with Rusthaven Western! Crafted as a bold western display font, it pairs heavy slab serifs and decorative side spurs with an authentic distressed timber texture. Its sturdy, hand-carved look delivers immediate rustic punch, making headlines feel grounded, historic, and full of character.\nIdeal for frontier signage, rodeo branding, timber and woodworking logos, craft whiskey packaging, vintage badgework, apparel graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring rugged frontier soul and classic Americana heritage to your designs with Rusthaven Western! Crafted as a bold western display font, it pairs heavy slab serifs and decorative side spurs with an authentic distressed timber texture. Its sturdy, hand-carved look delivers immediate rustic punch, making headlines feel grounded, historic, and full of character.</p>\n<p>Ideal for frontier signage, rodeo branding, timber and woodworking logos, craft whiskey packaging, vintage badgework, apparel graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
